1817:        action: "Mirror the frontier into the coverage graph so traversal does not depend on the leaf emitting graph events"
1823:          node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/frontier-admit.cjs graph --artifact-dir "{artifact_dir}" --output "{artifact_dir}/frontier-graph-events.json"
1824:          node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/upsert.cjs --spec-folder "{spec_folder}" --loop-type research --session-id "{config.lineage.sessionId}" --events "{artifact_dir}/frontier-graph-events.json"
1827:        on_failure: "Log the stderr line as a config_warning bookkeeping event and continue; the frontier store and registry stay authoritative."
1835:        source_note: "step_reduce_state has just rewritten all three, so the freshest view of this lineage is already on disk. No index, daemon or network call is involved."
1931:  phase_synthesis:
1970:          - divergence_summary: "Read registry.divergence and summarize saturated directions, completed pivots, failures, overrides, Council artifact refs, and remaining frontier; else 'no divergent pivots recorded'"
2037:            7. Preserve the mandatory `## Eliminated Alternatives` section, then add or replace `## Divergence Map` immediately after it and before Section 12 Open Questions. Populate it from `{state_paths.registry}` with saturated directions, pivots taken, evidence and Council artifact references, pivot failures and audited overrides, and the remaining frontier.
2045:            6. After the mandatory `## Eliminated Alternatives` section and before Section 12 Open Questions, add `## Divergence Map` with saturated directions, pivots taken, evidence and Council artifact references, pivot failures and audited overrides, and the remaining frontier from `{state_paths.registry}`.
2046:          Divergence Map documents breadth. Never claim the topic converged merely because divergent mode broadened the investigated frontier.
2064:          GATEWAY=".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs"
2065:          [ -f "$GATEWAY" ] || GATEWAY="scripts/append-mode-event.cjs"
2206:  phase_save:
2300:    - modify_config_after_initialization_outside_its_writer_steps  # step_extend_completed_run, step_frontier_budget and step_update_config_status
2319:      - "Live breadth growth is the opt-in --depth-mode=expansive frontier (step_frontier_seed, step_frontier_admit); waves stay reference-only."

